# Canonical guide

- **Authoritative reference:** repository root `CLAUDE.md` (complete make table, board/camera matrix, architecture tables, links to `README_CN.md` / `QUICKSTART_CN.md`, etc.). Open it when anything here is incomplete or ambiguous.
- **Stack:** **TuyaOS 3.13.6**, main application **`tuyaos_jiajia`** (product firmware), hardware class **T5 / BK7258** Wukong AI devices. Reference demo **`tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai`** remains under `apps/` for upstream comparison only.
- **Reference apps:** `apps/tuyaos_demo_examples/`, `apps/tuyaos_demo_quickstart/`.
